Cell["\<\
Matching block: these FindRoot calls solve for the v0 values that make the \
Tsallis and empirical rms values equal to the Maxwell-Boltzmann rms target. 
A large empirical root or failed convergence should be cross-checked against \
rms_matching_emp_check.nb.\
\>", "Text",
 CellFrame->{{0, 0}, {0, 0}},
